{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隨其犯者稱之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隨有稱之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說已"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語，此義翻為方便，由作此事是解脫之方便也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云善哉"}
{"id": null, "n": "0903001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0903001", "type": "orig", "text": "【原】明順治八年刊增上寺報恩藏本"}
